My review on the Art Exchange forum:



This is some mind-bendy Department of Miscommunications shit (yay, another baby of mine that has a life of its own on this site, love seeing these things crop up — though before you think me rude let me be the first to admit that it may be my baby but I am not the only parent) about music! I critiqued this before it got sent out, and I am glad to see the changes that happened. My favorite lines are still in here (Mr. Measure, a nice middle note) but a lot of what I felt was the more generic  stuff is gone. I really have no idea what is happening in this skip (even though I know the Misters are the three computers), but I do really like it. Fits the DoMc vibe perfectly.
